* A set symbol used before its first set, set again in a macro body (after a default set): r68's
* first pass ran the body too, so the earlier uses take its value; a set in a conditional the
* expansion leaves out takes nothing (it was an undefined NAME__p1).
* fixed: 3d5d87a 2026-10-11 r68togas: first-pass values of sets in macro bodies; psect without ends
* expect text: 00070000
 psect set_p1_macro,0,0,0,0,0
 dc.b Sides
 dc.b Dev
 dc.w 0
Sides set 2
DESC macro
 ifeq \1-1
Sides set 0
 endc
 ifeq \1-2
Dev set 5
 endc
 endm
 DESC 1
Dev set 7
 ends
